      "findings": "Reconstructed SBI's multi-rail relationships: SBI Group is a Circle SBI Holdings JV partner, USD50M Circle investor, Arc founding validator and ARC presale participant, while also promoting XRP through term-deposit/shareholder coupons and Visa card rewards, distributing RLUSD, and developing JPYSC/OUSD with Startale and SMBC. Coinbase now supports RLUSD on XRPL, Base and Ethereum through Prime/Exchange/app; Coinbase Global Exchange collateral support is future. Coinbase and Binance are Arc exchange access partners, not validators. Circle's USYC is supported as off-exchange collateral for Binance institutional derivatives; actual utilization is unknown. SBIC East Japan is a separate legal entity and its ChatGPT seminar was educational, not an OpenAI or XRP partnership. Corrected a Japanese-unit error: JPYSC short-term JGB allocation is JPY1.0B (10億円), not JPY10B; issuance ~JPY20.1B and lending applications ~JPY6.9B. No XRP price feature admitted; forecast remains NOT_ISSUED.",
